       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-COAX-KERMIT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-COAX-KERMIT-PROOFS.
           05  WS-TEM-PRIMACY-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-IMPEDANCE-OK             PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DECOUPLING-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COAX-LATENCY-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COAX-SEAL-OK             PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-COAX-KERMIT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PCX-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PCX-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-TEM-AND-IMPEDANCE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DECOUPLING-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PCX-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-TEM-AND-IMPEDANCE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TEM-PRIMACY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-IMPEDANCE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DECOUPLING-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DECOUPLING-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COAX-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PCX-PROOFS.
           IF WS-TEM-PRIMACY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-IMPEDANCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DECOUPLING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-COAX-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-COAX-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PCX-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PCX-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PCX-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PCX-CODE.
